## Conventions (rules, not suggestions)

Only the ones a competent engineer would otherwise get wrong. Everything a
linter enforces belongs in the linter, not here.

- **<Invariant>** — ...
- **<Pattern to imitate>** — name the canonical file to copy.

## Do / Don't

- **Don't** run the full test suite unless asked. Targeted runs only.
- **Don't** add comments that restate the code. Comment the *why*.
- **Don't** create new docs unless asked.
- **Don't** change lint/coverage thresholds — they are release gates.
- **Do** <the project-specific one that actually matters>.

## CI (what actually runs on PRs)

Name the **required** checks and how to run each locally. Distinguish required
from advisory: an agent that cannot tell them apart either ignores real gates or
blocks on cosmetic ones.

